{"parse": {"title": "RF-3", "pageid": 89557, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/RF-2\" title=\"RF-2\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">RF-3</span><a href=\"/wiki/RF-4\" title=\"RF-4\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">RF</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">3</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E9.80.90.E7.81.AB.E4.B9.8B.E4.BA.BA\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"逐火之人\">逐火之人</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 逐火之人</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">The Ones Chasing the Flame</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"><div class=\"tabber-filter-item selected\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"1\" style=\"padding:8px 4px; margin-bottom:-8px;\"><div class=\"episode-nav-item episode-nav-battle\"><i class=\"selected-icon\"><img alt=\"选中\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/20px-Img_xuanzhong.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"选中\" width=\"20\" height=\"19\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/30px-Img_xuanzhong.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/40px-Img_xuanzhong.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"48\" data-file-height=\"46\" /></i>走格子前</div></div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"2\" style=\"padding:8px 4px; margin-bottom:-8px;\"><div class=\"episode-nav-item episode-nav-battle\"><i class=\"selected-icon\"><img alt=\"选中\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/20px-Img_xuanzhong.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"选中\" width=\"20\" height=\"19\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/30px-Img_xuanzhong.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/40px-Img_xuanzhong.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"48\" data-file-height=\"46\" /></i>走格子后</div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"tabber-item tabber\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"1\"><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">和平乌鲁：</div><div>握紧拳头，挥出，收回，再挥出。她的手臂酸痛，但掌心仍然灼热。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">和平乌鲁：</div><div>我追逐着她——看着她反反复复地练习，花费时间、精力，把自己浑身变得滚烫，如同一团真正的小火苗。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/HeadIconSmall-307601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/HeadIconSmall-307601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/HeadIconSmall-307601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">和平乌鲁：</div><div>时间如同一道漫长的褶皱，它平静、深邃、难以探查，从脸颊一侧爬升到中央。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">和平乌鲁：</div><div>我很高兴看到她依然如此年轻，如此活蹦乱跳。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_5_at_huodezhuixun3.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_5_at_huodezhuixun3\"><img alt=\"1_5_at_huodezhuixun3\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e4/Cg-1_5_at_huodezhuixun3.png/600px-Cg-1_5_at_huodezhuixun3.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e4/Cg-1_5_at_huodezhuixun3.png/900px-Cg-1_5_at_huodezhuixun3.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e4/Cg-1_5_at_huodezhuixun3.png/1200px-Cg-1_5_at_huodezhuixun3.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307614.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/HeadIconSmall-307614.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307614.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307614.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/HeadIconSmall-307614.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307614.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/HeadIconSmall-307614.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307614.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">和平乌鲁：</div><div>我越是靠近她，越是觉得自己正在燃烧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/HeadIconSmall-307601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/HeadIconSmall-307601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/HeadIconSmall-307601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">和平乌鲁：</div><div>我知道，我从未真正意义上地熄灭过，我从未落回无光的深渊。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/HeadIconSmall-307601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/HeadIconSmall-307601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/HeadIconSmall-307601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">和平乌鲁：</div><div>但这与我再次见到她时又是不同的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307614.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/HeadIconSmall-307614.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307614.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307614.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/HeadIconSmall-307614.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307614.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/HeadIconSmall-307614.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307614.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">和平乌鲁：</div><div>你是因为听见我的声音，才捡起那些石块的吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307614.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/HeadIconSmall-307614.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307614.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307614.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/HeadIconSmall-307614.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307614.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/HeadIconSmall-307614.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307614.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">和平乌鲁：</div><div>你记得马林吉，记得运动会的场景吗？你还是你吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/HeadIconSmall-307601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/HeadIconSmall-307601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/HeadIconSmall-307601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">和平乌鲁：</div><div>我想，漫长的沉睡已经到了结束的时刻，那沉重的被褥也该离开我的身体。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_5_at_huodezhuixun3.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_5_at_huodezhuixun3\"><img alt=\"1_5_at_huodezhuixun3\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e4/Cg-1_5_at_huodezhuixun3.png/600px-Cg-1_5_at_huodezhuixun3.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e4/Cg-1_5_at_huodezhuixun3.png/900px-Cg-1_5_at_huodezhuixun3.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e4/Cg-1_5_at_huodezhuixun3.png/1200px-Cg-1_5_at_huodezhuixun3.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_5_bg_quanjichang1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_5_bg_quanjichang1\"><img alt=\"1_5_bg_quanjichang1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/Cg-1_5_bg_quanjichang1.png/600px-Cg-1_5_bg_quanjichang1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/Cg-1_5_bg_quanjichang1.png/900px-Cg-1_5_bg_quanjichang1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/Cg-1_5_bg_quanjichang1.png/1200px-Cg-1_5_bg_quanjichang1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教练：</div><div>可燃点，出拳再快些！注意你的脚步！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"620612.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/HeadIconSmall-620612.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-620612.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"620612.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/HeadIconSmall-620612.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-620612.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/HeadIconSmall-620612.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-620612.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>好的！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教练：</div><div>保持距离，别把脚后跟放下！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教练：</div><div>踩住脚尖，绷紧脚踝！拳头甩出去！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"620601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0e/HeadIconSmall-620601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-620601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"620601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0e/HeadIconSmall-620601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-620601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0e/HeadIconSmall-620601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-620601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>……好的！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"620601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0e/HeadIconSmall-620601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-620601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"620601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0e/HeadIconSmall-620601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-620601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0e/HeadIconSmall-620601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-620601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>深呼吸，让身体自然下沉……后退的同时出拳……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"620613.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f6/HeadIconSmall-620613.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-620613.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"620613.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f6/HeadIconSmall-620613.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-620613.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f6/HeadIconSmall-620613.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-620613.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>哈！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教练：</div><div>更快！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-zaluanxiaoxiang.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"zaluanxiaoxiang\"><img alt=\"zaluanxiaoxiang\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/Cg-zaluanxiaoxiang.png/600px-Cg-zaluanxiaoxiang.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/Cg-zaluanxiaoxiang.png/900px-Cg-zaluanxiaoxiang.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/Cg-zaluanxiaoxiang.png/1200px-Cg-zaluanxiaoxiang.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"620601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0e/HeadIconSmall-620601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-620601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"620601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0e/HeadIconSmall-620601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-620601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0e/HeadIconSmall-620601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-620601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>集中精神，集中精神……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"620601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0e/HeadIconSmall-620601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-620601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"620601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0e/HeadIconSmall-620601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-620601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0e/HeadIconSmall-620601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-620601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>放轻松，就这样抓住那粒火星……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教练：</div><div>连续两拳！快！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"620613.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f6/HeadIconSmall-620613.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-620613.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"620613.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f6/HeadIconSmall-620613.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-620613.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f6/HeadIconSmall-620613.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-620613.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>朝着一个方向……！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_5_bg_quanjichang1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_5_bg_quanjichang1\"><img alt=\"1_5_bg_quanjichang1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/Cg-1_5_bg_quanjichang1.png/600px-Cg-1_5_bg_quanjichang1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/Cg-1_5_bg_quanjichang1.png/900px-Cg-1_5_bg_quanjichang1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/Cg-1_5_bg_quanjichang1.png/1200px-Cg-1_5_bg_quanjichang1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教练：</div><div>好，停！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教练：</div><div>过去拿毛巾擦擦汗，休整好了再到拳台附近找我。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教练：</div><div>我还得盯着其他人的进度，你没问题吧？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"620601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0e/HeadIconSmall-620601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-620601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"620601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0e/HeadIconSmall-620601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-620601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0e/HeadIconSmall-620601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-620601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>哈……没、没问题，谢谢您……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>木板长椅算不上多舒服的坐具。但在训练场里，它可是抢手货。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>和同伴打过招呼，挪开长椅上的运动包，想法子挤出一点儿刚够塞下自己的空隙。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>——现在是宝贵的休息时间。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"620601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0e/HeadIconSmall-620601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-620601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"620601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0e/HeadIconSmall-620601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-620601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0e/HeadIconSmall-620601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-620601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>刚才我的手肘没收紧，步子也退得太大了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>步法，挥拳，这些要点拆开来明明都还算简单……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她从包里掏出笔记本，翻到了写着计划表的一页仔细查看。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>纸面之上挤得密密麻麻的，是精心写好的训练规划，配以可爱的装饰涂鸦。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"620610.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-620610.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-620610.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"620610.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-620610.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-620610.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-620610.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-620610.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>我要在哪儿挤出时间做专项练习呢……这些做不完的事儿……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"620611.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-620611.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-620611.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"620611.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-620611.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-620611.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-620611.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-620611.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>唉，所有东西放到一起就像作业里最难的习题！不不，还要更难！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"620611.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-620611.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-620611.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"620611.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-620611.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-620611.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-620611.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-620611.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>要躲开，就没法进攻，贸然出拳又容易暴露破绽……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"620611.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-620611.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-620611.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"620611.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-620611.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-620611.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-620611.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-620611.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她伸出左手，握拳，挥向自己——又及时让拳头在鼻尖前悬停。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>几次徒劳的尝试之后，这只手终于回到了身侧，在椅面敲出一段旋律。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"620610.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-620610.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-620610.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"620610.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-620610.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-620610.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-620610.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-620610.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>呜哇，有拳头打到面前，当然会想躲开它呀！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"620601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0e/HeadIconSmall-620601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-620601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"620601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0e/HeadIconSmall-620601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-620601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0e/HeadIconSmall-620601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-620601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>可燃点，可燃点，你必须鼓足勇气～</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"620601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0e/HeadIconSmall-620601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-620601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"620601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0e/HeadIconSmall-620601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-620601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0e/HeadIconSmall-620601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-620601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>别让教练发火，他平时虽然脾气不错，可是真生起气来可比塔西恶魔还可怕……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一团巨大的阴影将小女孩笼罩，她的小声嘀咕也不再是秘密。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><a href=\"/index.php?title=%E7%89%B9%E6%AE%8A:%E4%B8%8A%E4%BC%A0%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6&amp;wpDestFile=HeadIconSmall-620501.png\" class=\"new\" title=\"文件:HeadIconSmall-620501.png\">620501.png</a></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">教练：</div><div>那群吱吱喳喳的毛球有这么令人害怕？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"620613.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f6/HeadIconSmall-620613.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-620613.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"620613.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f6/HeadIconSmall-620613.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-620613.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f6/HeadIconSmall-620613.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-620613.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"620601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0e/HeadIconSmall-620601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-620601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"620601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0e/HeadIconSmall-620601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-620601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0e/HeadIconSmall-620601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-620601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>教……教练！您什么时候……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教练：</div><div>没关系，我是想和你聊几句。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他挥了挥手，将吵闹的有袋类毛球和那首孩子气的小调都抛到脑后。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教练：</div><div>有话我习惯直说，管他什么大人、孩子的，听点儿实话没坏处。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教练：</div><div>——你还要继续学拳击吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>什么……当然！今天的训练我确实做得不太好，我明白的！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>刚才我就在想，我太关注防守，所以拳头击出的时候不够有力！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>我能做得更好！我会花更多时间……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教练：</div><div>你刚才的训练表现很优秀。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一连串急迫的解释戛然而止。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>准备好的话全失去了方向，可燃点脸上的神情比她未动一笔的作业更加空白。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教练：</div><div>现在的孩子们才像塔西恶魔呢，个个说起话都不带停……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教练：</div><div>看，注意过你身后墙上的照片吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>当然！这是甘斯，然后……彭斯！巴特里克，还有……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教练：</div><div>而这是可燃点。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>手指朝向的是照片队列的最末，一片空白的，正等待被装饰的墙面。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教练：</div><div>在比赛中获得了……赢下了，属于她的金腰带。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教练：</div><div>我教过的孩子不少，里头有几个天赋很不错，你这家伙和他们比毫不逊色。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教练：</div><div>至少他们打不出你这样凌厉、迅速的一击。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>我真的能做到吗？赢下一条属于我的……金腰带？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教练：</div><div>你很有天赋，如果你走向这条路的话，我很确定，你可以得到它。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教练：</div><div>而我们现在的问题是，你应该做一个选择了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教练：</div><div>拳击很有趣，你很喜欢，我也一样，我不需要多多对你赘述它的魅力。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教练：</div><div>但我也必须提醒你，成为一个专业拳击手将要面对的一切和现在截然不同，这可能会改变你的人生。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教练：</div><div>它不只是更高强度的训练，更严苛的标准那么简单……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>我想……我愿意——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教练：</div><div>这不是一个简单的选择，你必须想好了再做决定。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教练：</div><div>回去和你的父母聊一聊吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>……我明白了。</div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"tabber-item tabber\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"2\"><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-0riverside.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"0riverside\"><img alt=\"0riverside\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/Cg-0riverside.png/600px-Cg-0riverside.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/Cg-0riverside.png/900px-Cg-0riverside.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/Cg-0riverside.png/1200px-Cg-0riverside.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"621301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-621301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-621301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"621301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-621301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-621301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-621301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-621301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">米娅：</div><div>小火，快跟上！我们都快捡完小石头了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"621301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-621301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-621301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"621301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-621301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-621301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-621301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-621301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">米娅：</div><div>来吧，我找到两块特别平整的，给你。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"620601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0e/HeadIconSmall-620601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-620601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"620601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0e/HeadIconSmall-620601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-620601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0e/HeadIconSmall-620601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-620601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_5_at_huodezhuixun2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_5_at_huodezhuixun2\"><img alt=\"1_5_at_huodezhuixun2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4d/Cg-1_5_at_huodezhuixun2.png/600px-Cg-1_5_at_huodezhuixun2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4d/Cg-1_5_at_huodezhuixun2.png/900px-Cg-1_5_at_huodezhuixun2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4d/Cg-1_5_at_huodezhuixun2.png/1200px-Cg-1_5_at_huodezhuixun2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"620601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0e/HeadIconSmall-620601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-620601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"620601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0e/HeadIconSmall-620601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-620601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0e/HeadIconSmall-620601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-620601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>……啊，谢谢你！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"621201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/HeadIconSmall-621201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-621201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"621201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/HeadIconSmall-621201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-621201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/HeadIconSmall-621201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-621201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">萨姆：</div><div>教练今天训你了？嗨，他每堂课都要嫌我一两句，没什么大不了的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"620601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0e/HeadIconSmall-620601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-620601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"620601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0e/HeadIconSmall-620601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-620601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0e/HeadIconSmall-620601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-620601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>不，不是，他问我要不要试着做个专业拳击手，我一路上都在想这件事……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>我想答应他，但他说这不是一个简单的选择……我必须得和我的爸爸妈妈聊一聊。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"621201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/HeadIconSmall-621201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-621201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"621201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/HeadIconSmall-621201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-621201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/HeadIconSmall-621201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-621201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">萨姆：</div><div>哇！职业拳手——！！！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>仅仅是四个字，就足够引发孩子们的惊叹和想象。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"621301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-621301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-621301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"621301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-621301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-621301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-621301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-621301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">米娅：</div><div>小火，我明天带一件T恤让你签名，好吗？</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-woshi_ye.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"woshi_ye\"><img alt=\"woshi_ye\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/Cg-woshi_ye.png/600px-Cg-woshi_ye.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/Cg-woshi_ye.png/900px-Cg-woshi_ye.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/Cg-woshi_ye.png/1200px-Cg-woshi_ye.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"621301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-621301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-621301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"621301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-621301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-621301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-621301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-621301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">米娅：</div><div>等你拿下很多冠军，我就把它挂在我的房间里！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"621201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/HeadIconSmall-621201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-621201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"621201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/HeadIconSmall-621201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-621201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/HeadIconSmall-621201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-621201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">萨姆：</div><div>我也要签名！给我签两个，不，十个！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-zaluanxiaoxiang.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"zaluanxiaoxiang\"><img alt=\"zaluanxiaoxiang\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/Cg-zaluanxiaoxiang.png/600px-Cg-zaluanxiaoxiang.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/Cg-zaluanxiaoxiang.png/900px-Cg-zaluanxiaoxiang.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/Cg-zaluanxiaoxiang.png/1200px-Cg-zaluanxiaoxiang.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>签名？别闹啦，什么签名，你真想要我写的字，就去我的作业本上扯一页纸下来好啦——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"621201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/HeadIconSmall-621201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-621201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"621201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/HeadIconSmall-621201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-621201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/HeadIconSmall-621201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-621201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">萨姆：</div><div>别想那么多，实在嫌麻烦拒绝就是了！对了，今天的游戏你还参加吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>被朋友塞进手心的卵石微微发热。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>今天是个好天气，阳光从叶片之间漏下，空气中弥漫的尘土也闪亮。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>深呼吸，让被烘得暖融融的新鲜气息涌进胸腔。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>……呼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>参加！当然参加！看我这就把你们打个落花流——啊！好痛！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>疲倦与肌肉的疼痛终于追上了这个活泼的姑娘。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"621301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-621301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-621301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"621301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-621301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-621301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-621301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-621301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">米娅：</div><div>你还好吗，小火？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>只是一点肌肉酸痛，我没事，我回家——回家按摩按摩就好！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>这是常有的事儿，别在意，我照样能得第一名！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>抉择只能暂时搁置，却不会无声无息地消失。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>或早，或晚。她依旧需要做出决定。</div></div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "含有受损文件链接的页面"}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "RF-3"}}